== diags.diag/fails-shorthand-before-uses
BYN1065 7:19 `uses` must come before `fails`; the order is `where`, `expects`, `uses`, `becomes`, `fails`
  label out of order
  help move `uses` before `fails`
  fix 7:11-7:31 uses console fails F
BYN1031 7:4 `T!E` is an input form; write `T f() fails E`
  label the input form
  help write `fails E, F` as the last clause of the signature
  fix 7:4-7:31  g() uses console fails E, F
